  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "Muse",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMuse Audio Dataset (CN / EN)\n\t\n\nPaper | Code\nThis repository contains a large-scale collection of generated music tracks introduced in the paper \"Muse: Towards Reproducible Long-Form Song Generation with Fine-Grained Style Control\".\nThe dataset consists of 116k fully licensed synthetic songs with automatically generated lyrics and style descriptions paired with audio synthesized by SunoV5. The dataset is divided into Chinese (CN) and English (EN) subsets.To comply with repository\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/bolshyC/Muse.",
  "alternateName": [
    "bolshyC/Muse"
  ],
